  "abilities": [],
  "behavior": "It usually moves alongside other scorplings or stays near larger scorpions. In combat it attacks directly at close range and relies more on numbers than on complex moves.",
  "interactionWithPlayer": "On its own it is not very dangerous, but its small size and tendency to appear in groups can make it annoying, especially while you are fighting an adult or juvenile scorpion.",
  "interactionWithCreatures": "Several scorplings are often found together and near other scorpions. They can also become involved in fights against other creatures that frequent the area.",
  "strategy": "Prioritize weapons or attacks with area damage. They are small and usually appear in groups, so hitting several at once is much faster than fighting them individually. If they are accompanying a larger scorpion, clearing them first can make the rest of the fight much more comfortable.",
  "groupId": null,
